&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-authentik&#34;&gt;What is authentik?
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;authentik is an open-source Identity Provider (IdP) for modern SSO. It supports SAML, OAuth2/OIDC, LDAP, RADIUS, and more, designed for self-hosting from small labs to large production clusters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://goauthentik.io/pricing&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;enterprise offering&lt;/a&gt; is available for organizations to securely replace existing IdPs such as Okta, Auth0, Entra ID, and Ping Identity for robust, large-scale identity management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;installation&#34;&gt;Installation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker Compose: recommended for small/test setups. See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.goauthentik.io/docs/install-config/install/docker-compose/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes (Helm Chart): recommended for larger setups. See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.goauthentik.io/docs/install-config/install/kubernetes/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt; and the Helm chart &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/goauthentik/helm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;repository&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS CloudFormation: deploy on AWS using our official templates. See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.goauthentik.io/docs/install-config/install/aws/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DigitalOcean Marketplace: one-click deployment via the official Marketplace app. See the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://marketplace.digitalocean.com/apps/authentik&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;app listing&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
